---
import cn from 'src/utils/cn';

const container = cn('mx-auto max-w-[1600px] px-6 md:px-10');
---

<section class="relative py-20 md:py-28 overflow-hidden">
  <div class={container}>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-1 lg:col-start-2 hidden lg:flex items-center justify-center">
        <span class="quote-mark">"</span>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-8 reveal">
        <p class="font-display italic font-light text-[clamp(1.6rem,3.4vw,3rem)] leading-[1.15] tracking-tight text-ink/90">
          Toda la Escritura es inspirada por Dios, y útil para enseñar, para
          <span class="text-primary">redargüir</span>, para corregir, para instruir en justicia.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-4 font-ui text-[11px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-ink/60">
          <span class="w-10 h-px bg-ink/30"></span>
          2 Timoteo 3:16
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
